WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.340
An assistant that knows your company.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:04.864
This video builds one:

00:00:04.864 --> 00:00:08.892
you give an AI profile your documents and the articles of your site,

00:00:08.892 --> 00:00:13.083
then test that it answers from them, shows where each answer came from,

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:15.260
and says so when it does not know.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:24.800
An AI profile that searches your documents and your data before it answers.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:29.560
Answers that show where they came from, as numbered sources.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:35.077
If you want, an assistant that answers only from your knowledge, and says

00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:37.490
so when it cannot find the answer.

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:47.570
The knowledge is kept in search indexes, on a search service that your technical team provides.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:53.187
You need an AI connection with a chat deployment and an embedding deployment,

00:00:53.187 --> 00:00:56.940
and the permission to manage AI profiles and data sources.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:02.388
Here, the documents index and a data source of the help articles are ready.

00:01:02.388 --> 00:01:05.230
The earlier videos show how to create them.

00:01:09.423 --> 00:01:13.940
Open the profile, open the Knowledge tab, and upload your document.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.106
Here it is the return policy.

00:01:16.106 --> 00:01:18.953
It shows a Pending badge until you save.

00:01:19.425 --> 00:01:24.278
Documents on a profile are background knowledge for every conversation with it.

00:01:24.278 --> 00:01:27.875
Replace one by removing it and uploading the new version.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.484
Next, the content of your site.

00:01:34.484 --> 00:01:38.430
On the same tab, choose the Help articles data source.

00:01:38.887 --> 00:01:45.607
Tick Restrict answers to retrieved data only, so that the assistant never answers from general knowledge.

00:01:46.068 --> 00:01:47.223
Click Save.

00:01:47.223 --> 00:01:51.368
The document is read, split into passages, and indexed.

00:01:55.543 --> 00:02:00.577
Open a chat with the profile, and ask a question that only your document answers:

00:02:00.577 --> 00:02:02.603
can I return opened software?

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:05.693
The assistant answers from the document:

00:02:05.693 --> 00:02:08.045
opened software cannot be returned.

00:02:08.512 --> 00:02:11.881
Now ask a question that an article of the site answers:

00:02:11.881 --> 00:02:14.202
how long does express shipping take?

00:02:14.664 --> 00:02:16.748
The answer comes from the article.

00:02:16.748 --> 00:02:21.124
It carries a small number, and the numbered source under it names the article.

00:02:21.578 --> 00:02:25.256
Finally, ask something that your knowledge does not cover:

00:02:25.256 --> 00:02:27.958
what is the favorite color of the C.E.O.?

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:34.140
Because answers are restricted, the assistant says that it cannot find it, instead of guessing.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:43.461
Start with a few good, current documents, rather than everything you have.

00:02:43.461 --> 00:02:46.790
Out of date files lead to out of date answers.

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:50.642
Change a page, and a data source follows.

00:02:50.642 --> 00:02:56.780
Replace a document, by removing the old one from the profile and uploading the new one.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:02.950
To let people ask about their own files, allow session document uploads on the profile.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:09.868
Upload documents, connect a data source, restrict the answers, and test.

00:03:09.868 --> 00:03:13.461
Your assistant now answers from your own knowledge.

00:03:13.461 --> 00:03:15.100
Thanks for watching.

